                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَغَمَ</span></b> 
                        , aor. 
    
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَغِمَ</span></b> 
                         and 
    
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَغَمَ</span></b> 
                        , <i>He spoke in a low,
